# Build context for the dedicated-server image. Only the engine sources and the
# docker/ files are needed: game data is mounted at runtime, and the Mac/Vita
# build trees leave object files and a Mach-O binary in quakespasm/Quake that
# must never be linked into a Linux image (ld: "file in wrong format").
*
!quakespasm/
!docker/
**/*.o
**/*.obj
**/*.a
quakespasm/Quake/quakespasm
